WebBeach
Copyright (c) 2026 Oceanum

WebBeach is a nearshore wave and flow solver for WebGPU, written in
TypeScript and WGSL. It is a reimplementation of the XBeach surfbeat
hydrodynamics (wave action balance, roller energy and shallow-water flow),
written by reference to the XBeach Fortran source and documentation:

